    "synthesis": "A single 12.616188 dB offset frozen from the prior 06:00 UTC response-corrected median generalized to a new 18:00 UTC holdout without refitting. The holdout residual median was only +0.420 dB after response correction, corrected residual IQR was 2.082 dB, 16 of 17 complete paired windows were within ±3 dB in both raw and corrected power, and all three fixed subband residual medians remained within the preregistered ±2.5 dB gate. Across four non-overlapping time samples, the H10S2-over-H10N1 difference is therefore compactly described by a persistent broadband multiplicative station-path factor over this date block. This remains a descriptive measurement-path result, not a physical-cause identification."
